{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8001_p", "source_sha256": "bcb67f12942f90e7d5266ee81baa9ee4e84d86e8ffc99e504aa0100afc995f5d", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』の撮影。\n育のテーマは『バーテンダー』だが……）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的拍摄。\n育的主题是“调酒师”，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8002_030iku", "source_sha256": "6fd32ede36246822855c68566c51c7118aac73313bd6b13655b344aa5a815562", "ja": "ねえ{$P$}さん。さっき\nセットを見たけど、ジュースしかなかったよ？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。我刚才看了下布景，里面只有果汁呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8003_030iku", "source_sha256": "51544da452d5e7e3f81f1d1bfe227c6ee7ba3132d9cf0a60fe7f462911a7b451", "ja": "バーテンダーさんって、お酒を出す人なんだよね？\n本物のバーテンダーさんが怒っちゃわないかな……。", "zh": "调酒师就是给人提供酒水的人，对吧？\n真正的调酒师不会生气吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8004_p", "source_sha256": "eaa8b3fec928810f3f1471664059f52065f51dcc34ae5f7a8953ba6f9dedca40", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。今日は『バーテンダーごっこ』なんだ。\n育は、バーテンダーのお芝居を思い切りしてほしい。", "zh": "没事的。今天只是“过家家版调酒师”。\n我希望育能尽情发挥，演好调酒师的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8005_030iku", "source_sha256": "008e1fe054b315f806ae117ebaccbe489eed27b4b7a099f6d14b294ec749344c", "ja": "バーテンダーさん……ごっこ……。", "zh": "调酒师……扮演游戏……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8006_030iku", "source_sha256": "e70db146bac53d9d6ee7c4bf7fd686d67ad0b19903477db4751b9dd0347494aa", "ja": "……大人っぽいお仕事ができると思って、\n楽しみにしてたのになぁ。", "zh": "……我还以为能做像大人一样的工作，\n一直很期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8007", "source_sha256": "a190685aa6b252052012ea588bb29d26c5a36aaf93fcce24c8f9c5ca66b3eaf6", "ja": "育がお手本だ！", "zh": "育就是榜样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8008", "source_sha256": "7089dcaf66d6897e1d54e1a0f5119f6bab5ce4a6b6326a5c314ad06e8b0aa10c", "ja": "育にしかできない", "zh": "只有育才能做到", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8009", "source_sha256": "eabc8c946607ed6b5cc1b7bb4c342d0f75400ca2a40ca5a918abfa5cd1039c40", "ja": "ごめんな……", "zh": "抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8100_p", "source_sha256": "fad864018de1eb4665866f2b2556a6679ac28c6a8e5f3c095db5323dcbc09bf2", "ja": "育の言う通り、バーは大人の世界だ。だから今日\n体験して、育がお友達のお手本になるんだ！", "zh": "正如育所说，酒吧是大人的世界。所以今天体验过之后，育就能成为朋友们的好榜样了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8101_030iku", "source_sha256": "683d5dc69279b460a05415b1d40d429e5fe2bfa3dca9af3ed0ec2d5cbc3bcfa5", "ja": "わたしがお手本……。そっか。\nみんなは、バーがどんなところか知らないもんね。", "zh": "我来当榜样……这样啊。\n毕竟大家还不知道酒吧是个什么样的地方嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8102_030iku", "source_sha256": "f9c9254b39bf451686121f091d3e79b9d2145a9f253d15708a93f8693038739a", "ja": "わかった、{$P$}さん！\nわたし、がんばってバーテンダーさんになってみるね♪", "zh": "明白了，{$P$}先生！  \n我会努力试着当个调酒师哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8200_p", "source_sha256": "e04ba9bbd00811570b4247469bd5427a41045daa0f787b9914d5ee059adbd64b", "ja": "やることはほとんど、バーテンダーと同じなんだ。\n大人っぽい仕事で、育にしか出せない魅力を見せよう！", "zh": "要做的事情基本和调酒师一样。\n通过这份成熟的工作，展现出只有育才能展现的魅力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8201_030iku", "source_sha256": "5cb520409208638a8da1fab1fa0af72e2ab772a863fdc1c0e74ab0d5f8a48fc0", "ja": "バーテンダーさんと同じなの？　……えへへ。\n飲み物を出したり、お話したりすればいいんだよね。", "zh": "和调酒师一样吗？……嘿嘿。\n端上饮料，再聊聊天就可以了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8202_030iku", "source_sha256": "99cbaa69ef6394b4ea5ae4071d5191f1e805afb71450396b5f503f4304eb8f69", "ja": "本当は大人の人がやるお仕事だけど、やってみる！\nいっぱいがんばるから、ちゃんと見ててね♪", "zh": "虽然这是大人才会做的工作，但我会试试的！\n我会努力加油的，所以要好好看着我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8300_p", "source_sha256": "1ed8138319a3269782d1803b2f46b0cc7f9ed55760f8e449aaceb1240fe34e61", "ja": "色々考えて、これが精一杯だったんだ。\n育の期待を裏切るつもりはなかったんだけど……。", "zh": "我想了很多，这已经是我能做到的极限了。我没打算辜负育的期待，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8301_030iku", "source_sha256": "e6eef8d62747b02f267ead0ee51bcab57aaa464d26b22c7301830d950e317d8f", "ja": "謝らないで、{$P$}さん！\nわたし、困らせたかったわけじゃないよ。", "zh": "别道歉，{$P$}先生！\n我又不是想让你为难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_8302_030iku", "source_sha256": "811ea5d6e4c2b42809f4ab3210f5db0d1a0db5e07976e91018f8f04009ede45e", "ja": "……お仕事だからがんばるけど。\n次はもうちょっと大人っぽいお仕事にしてね？", "zh": "……虽然因为是工作我会努力的。\n下次要给我安排更成熟一点的工作哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
